{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "order-api-collection",
		"name": "Order API - User Checkout",
		"description": "Complete order management and checkout endpoints for authenticated users.\n\n**Payment Flow:**\n- All requests use form-data format\n- Cash payments: Basic fields only (address_id, payment_method, notes)\n- Online payments: Include payment gateway fields as flat form-data\n\n**New Features:**\n- Single-step checkout with payment details\n- Payment records stored in separate payments table\n- Cart deletion based on payment success\n- Boolean fields: Use 1 for true, 0 for false\n- Legacy confirm-payment endpoint still available",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{user_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:8000/api/user",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "user_token",
			"value": "YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "order_id",
			"value": "1",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Checkout - Cash on Delivery",
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Accept",
						"value": "application/json",
						"type": "text"
					},
					{
						"key": "Accept-Language",
						"value": "en",
						"type": "text",
						"description": "Change to 'ar' for Arabic"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "formdata",
					"formdata": [
						{
							"key": "address_id",
							"value": "1",
							"description": "User's delivery address ID (required)",
							"type": "text"
						},
						{
							"key": "payment_method",
							"value": "cash",
							"description": "Payment method: cash or online (required)",
							"type": "text"
						},
						{
							"key": "notes",
							"value": "Please call before delivery",
							"description": "Optional order notes (max 500 chars)",
							"type": "text"
						}
					]
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/checkout",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"checkout"
					]
				},
				"description": "Checkout cart with cash on delivery payment.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n- User must be authenticated\n- Cart must have items\n- Address must belong to user\n\n**Response Codes:**\n- 201: Order created successfully, cart cleared\n- 404: Cart is empty\n- 422: Validation error\n- 500: Server error\n\n**Expected Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Order placed successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"order\": {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"order_number\": \"ORD-20251030-00001\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"payment_method\": \"cash\",\n      \"total\": \"160.00\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"
			},
			"response": []
		},
