				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/checkout",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"checkout"
					]
				},
				"description": "Checkout with successful online payment.\n\n**Payment Flow:**\n1. User completes payment at gateway\n2. Gateway returns payment details\n3. Submit checkout with payment_details\n4. Order created + Payment processed in single transaction\n\n**Result:**\n- Order status: `confirmed`\n- Payment status: `paid`\n- Payment record created in payments table\n- Cart deleted\n\n**Expected Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Payment confirmed successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"order\": {\n      \"id\": 2,\n      \"order_number\": \"ORD-20251111-00002\",\n      \"status\": \"confirmed\",\n      \"payment_method\": \"online\",\n      \"payment_status\": \"paid\",\n      \"payment_reference\": \"367786330\",\n      \"total\": \"100.00\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"
			},
			"response": []
		},
