				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"orders",
						"{{order_id}}"
					]
				},
				"description": "Get complete details of a specific order.\n\n**URL Parameter:**\n- Replace `{{order_id}}` with actual order ID\n\n**Response Includes:**\n- Complete order information\n- All items with product snapshots\n- Selected options and addons\n- Store details\n- Delivery address snapshot\n- Price breakdown\n- Status labels (localized)\n\n**Response Codes:**\n- 200: Order found\n- 404: Order not found or doesn't belong to user"
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "6. Cancel Order",
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Accept",
						"value": "application/json",
						"type": "text"
					},
					{
						"key": "Accept-Language",
						"value": "en",
						"type": "text"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "formdata",
					"formdata": [
						{
							"key": "reason",
							"value": "Changed my mind",
							"description": "Optional cancellation reason",
							"type": "text"
						}
					]
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}/cancel",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"orders",
						"{{order_id}}",
						"cancel"
					]
				},
				"description": "Cancel a pending order.\n\n**Cancellation Rules:**\n- ✅ Can cancel: `pending` or `pending_payment` status\n- ❌ Cannot cancel: `confirmed` or later statuses\n\n**URL Parameter:**\n- Replace `{{order_id}}` with actual order ID\n\n**Form Data:**\n- `reason`: Optional cancellation reason (max 500 chars)\n\n**Response Codes:**\n- 200: Order cancelled successfully\n- 400: Cannot cancel (wrong status)\n- 404: Order not found"
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "6b. Confirm Payment (Legacy)",
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
